      <description><![CDATA[
        The final arrivals of 24 MH-60R Seahawk helicopters complete a vital US-India naval pact, sharply upgrading the Indian Navy&#39;s anti-submarine posture in the Indo-Pacific. Here is our deep-dive analysis on the strategic implications.
        
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ Advanced sensors, including airborne low-frequency sonar (ALFS) and Hellfire missiles, transform the fleet into a dual-role hunter-killer platform.
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ The acquisition bridges legacy obsolescence left by the aging Sea King fleet, restoring critical maritime domain awareness.
        [SPLIT]
